<title>FINLAND: ATRIA SAYS 97 PROFIT TO AT LEAST MATCH 96.</title>
<headline>ATRIA SAYS 97 PROFIT TO AT LEAST MATCH 96.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish meat processing group Atria Oy said on Monday its 1997 operating profit would at least match the 1996 level.</p>
<p>&quot;The group expects 1997 operating profit to at least match the 1996 level,&quot; Atria said in a statement with an issue prospectus.</p>
<p>Atria earlier announced it will create a new A series of shares and launch a rights issue of 4.3 million new A shares.  </p>
<p>Atria's operating profit last year was 103 million markka, up from 97 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
